===Etymology===
From {{inh|ru|zle-oru|*мужчина}}, {{m|orv|мущина}}, from {{inh|ru|orv|*мѫжьщина}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*mǫžьščina}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*mǫžьskъ}} + {{m|sla-pro|*-ina}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*mǫžь}} + {{m|sla-pro|*-ьskъ}}. Equivalent to {{suffix|ru|мужско́й|ина}}.

